AB  - <div data-language="eng" data-ev-field="abstract">As the main material in the production process of a concrete segmental beam in the traditional infrastructure industry, the processing automation is low and the quality is difficult to control, which affects the overall mechanical properties of the structure. To improve the efficiency and quality of steel processing, regarding the segmental beams of Huangmaohai Link as the research object, adopting the idea of the combination of "software & hardware", the reinforcement model established by BIM technology is used as the data source of intelligent building, and the intelligent tooling is used as the "executor"of brilliant construction data source, and the soft and hard interaction. The results show that visualization simulation optimization of steel reinforcement and the control of intelligent construction data sources of steel reinforcement can be realized through BIM technology. The correct BIM-reinforced model can optimize the nesting and generate the blanking list based on the integer programming algorithm so that the residual material rate of the material is the lowest, which is conducive to cost-saving control. The intelligent tooling equipment can read the blanking list into the equipment, realize the intelligent processing of the semi-finished products of steel bars and mesh, and ensure the quality of reinforcement processing, which can enhance the disaster prevention ability of Bridges. Finally, the steel BIM model will be transformed into an engineering entity through intelligent tooling with high efficiency and low cost, which enhances the ability of bridges to prevent earthquakes and reduce disasters. Research results will drive the development of smart manufacturing technologies in the overall infrastructure industry.<br/></div> © Published under licence by IOP Publishing Ltd.
