AB  - <div data-language="eng" data-ev-field="abstract">Integrated chemo-physics and mechanistic modeling is presented with regard to the multi-scale referential volume for behavioral simulation of reinforced concrete in service. The timescale of application ranges from nano-second for explosive events to years or century for life cycle of building and infrastructures. The developed simulation platform is being applied to the performance assessment of both new-designed and existing reinforced concrete on the scheme of performance-based design.<br/></div> © 2023 The Author(s).
