EP  - 32
TI  - Probabilistic life-cycle performance assessment of corroded concrete structures: Core technologies to predict the remaining service life
T2  - Life-Cycle of Structures and Infrastructure Systems - Proceedings of the 8th International Symposium on Life-Cycle Civil Engineering, IALCCE 2023
UR  - http://dx.doi.org/10.1201/9781003323020-2
