AB  - The Harmonic Innovation Hub being launched in Catanzaro is not an object or a model, but rather the concrete implementation of a futuristic vision of the business world, and as engaging as it is risky. This paper presents some elements relating to this reality and its operation; first and foremost, it illustrates the innovating drive of those who have spent their lives imagining new scenarios and their own resources, seeking to make them concrete and usable. Finally, some ideas on the possible connections with the manufacturing industry complete the overview of the experience the Hub is gaining, which could revolutionise the production context in the region and beyond. © 2022 The Authors. Published by ELSEVIER B.V.
