AB  - A real-case study is presented aiming at contributing to the
understanding of environmental and economic sustainability of lime-based
mortars, renders and plasters manufacturing in Europe. A Life Cycle
Inventory is presented and used for scenario analysis. The Life Cycle
Assessment shows that the binders' production dominates the Climate
Change, Resources and Ecosystem quality categories while additives are
critical in Human Health. The CO2 emissions can have a direct impact on
the total costs (up to 40%) considering the 2022 carbon pricing. A
holistic analysis and suggestions (mix composition and critical
processes) to increase the sustainability in the sector is provided.
