AB  - Precision machinery employs a variety of materials for its structures:
cast iron, welded steel, natural stone, mineral cast, ultra-high
performance concrete. Granite and gabbro stone sorts are occasionally
used in high-precision machine tools, and in the metrological industry
due to their long-term stability as a result of low residual stresses in
the material. For this work, experiments were set up to analyze and
evaluate the influence of humidity variations as well as water exposure
on the geometrical and dimensional characteristics of natural stones.
